Scoped unsharp video filter

The option table (luma/chroma/alpha msize_x, msize_y and amount with their
lx/ly/la, cx/cy/ca and ax/ay/aa aliases), the pix_fmts list, set_filter_param
(amount*65536.0, steps, scalebits, halfscale and the MAX_SCALEBITS check),
the odd-size check of init_filter_param, the nb_threads computation of
config_input, apply_unsharp's plane geometry and the eight-bit row and column
finite-state-machine accumulation with edge replication of unsharp_slice_8 in
src/video-ops/unsharp.ts follow libavfilter/vf_unsharp.c (unsharp_options,
pix_fmts, set_filter_param, init, init_filter_param, config_input,
apply_unsharp, DEF_UNSHARP_SLICE_FUNC, filter_frame).
